Why Do We Overthink Everything? 🧠 | Psychology Explained #shorts
Why does your brain keep thinking about things even when you want to stop? 🧠

From overthinking at night to worrying about the future, discover the psychology behind repetitive negative thoughts.

In this video, we explore:

- Why we overthink everything
- What are worry and rumination?
- Why does our brain repeat negative thoughts?
- How can we break the overthinking cycle?

Your mind is powerful. Learn to understand it.

Subscribe to SOCH SIGNAL for more Human Psychology, Brain Facts and Mind Mysteries.

